Subject: SOP Attention-First Language Foundation

Description: Signed rebuild foundation that treats SOP as a language for observable attention-state transformation and inference coordination before subjects, faculties, or artifact workflows are defined.

Name: SAIL — Semantic Attention and Inference Language.

